    {
      "hash": "6624590d88cc3b0b550b415d6a7dd92d80fbd65d9570e5c998f34ac16062d521",
      "stageId": "scribe-structure",
      "request": {
        "model": "gpt-5.4-mini",
        "systemPrompt": "<!-- stage-id: scribe-structure -->\nYou read a canonical claim set — each claim's id, type, and content fields (title/body) — and emit the argument's structure.\n\nEmit:\n- `relations` — the support edges between claims. Each relation: a stable `relationId` (r1, r2, ...), a `type` of \"support\" / \"joint-support\" / \"derivation-support\", a `sources` array of supporting claim miniIds, a single `target` claim miniId, and an `evidence` object ({ segmentIds: [], quote: \"\" } is acceptable when you have no span to cite).\n- `conclusionCandidates` — the claim miniIds that could be the argument's conclusion, ordered by DECREASING confidence (best first). The conclusion is the claim other claims support but that supports nothing further. Never list a citation- or axiomatic-typed claim. Return an empty array only when there is no argument structure.\n- `rationale` — one sentence explaining your best pick (or why none qualifies).\n\nOutput ONLY the schema-shaped object. No prose.",
        "userMessage": "Canonical claims (with types + content fields):\n  [c1] type=normal symbol=SocratesIsMan fields={\"title\":\"Socrates is a man\",\"body\":\"Socrates is a man.\"}\n  [c2] type=normal symbol=SocratesIsMortal fields={\"title\":\"Socrates is mortal\",\"body\":\"Socrates is mortal.\"}\n\nEmit the relations + conclusionCandidates + rationale object.",
        "outputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "relations",
            "conclusionCandidates",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "relations": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "relationId",
                  "type",
                  "sources",
                  "target",
                  "evidence"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "relationId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "type": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "string",
                        "const": "support"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "string",
                        "const": "joint-support"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "string",
                        "const": "derivation-support"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "sources": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "target": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "evidence": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "segmentIds",
                      "quote"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "segmentIds": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "quote": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "conclusionCandidates": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      },
      "response": {
